  "_doc": "Every texture, sky and model the site ships. scripts/fetch_polyhaven.py downloads the 'polyhaven' entries (run on the PC, the cloud cannot reach Poly Haven) and rewrites CREDITOS.md; scripts/compress-assets.mjs turns each 'out' into KTX2 / meshopt files in public/. encode: color = ETC1S sRGB, data = ETC1S linear (AO/roughness/metal), normal = UASTC + zstd (normalSize: smaller normal maps), copy = as is.",
